long_desc:
Melia Kuala Lumpur is a 4 star international hotel located opposite of Times Square Shopping Centre, a one stop entertainment centre which includes an indoor theme park, retail outlets and IMAX theatre. It is surrounded by business complexes, major shopping malls and entertainment spots in the city centre of Kuala Lumpur. &lt;/br&gt;
&lt;/br&gt;
Refurbishment Work on The Level Category and Lobby Area ~ 
&lt;/br&gt;
Meliá Kuala Lumpur will start the 3rd phrase of refurbishment work on The Level category (13th – 17th floor) and will extend the period of renovation until end of June 2017.
&lt;/br&gt;
Period of renovation from 1st February until May 2017. &lt;/br&gt;
Working time: 10.00am – 06.00pm&lt;/br&gt;
Working day: Monday to Sunday&lt;/br&gt;
Area: The Level Category (13th – 17th floor) and Lobby Area &lt;/br&gt;
&lt;/br&gt;
Disturbance to guests: Only day time noise including painting, drilling, hammering etc, the beginning stage will involve drilling and wall hacking,
and the Hotel will have one below closed as buffer floors

Dear Valued Business Partners,

MELIA KUALA LUMPUR

~ Upgrading Work at Swimming Pool ~

Meliá Kuala Lumpur is currently undergoing the upgrading work at Swimming Pool and will extend the period of renovation until June 2017.

Period of renovation 	Till end of June 2017
Working time	10.00 – 18.00 hrs
Working day	Monday to Sunday
Area	Swimming Pool
Kind of work  	including painting, drilling, hammering etc. Only at the beginning stage will involves drilling and wall hacking 
Any disturbance to guests	Only day time noise and we will have one below closed as buffer floors
Any further comments 	The construction will be covered. The hotel has a thorough security and safe plan. Guest cannot access to renovation floors, as guests lifts are blocked to this floors.
Alternative option	Swimming pool for guest at Federal Hotel - guest will be required to contact hotel on-duty staff.
